      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The lake’s shape resembles a dragon, with eight coves ranging from 400 to 1,300 feet long.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        18
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://holidaylakes.org/about",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "A 45‑foot high, 500‑foot long dam creates the lake, while a smaller 7‑acre Big Bass Lake sits nearby for fishing.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        19,
        22
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://holidaylakes.org/about",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Holiday Lakes offers two sandy beaches: a 500‑by‑140‑foot main beach and a 200‑by‑100‑foot east beach.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        23,
        24
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://holidaylakes.org/about",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
